ck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 07:47:21 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 08:07:28 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 08:26:22 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database modification detected. Forcing reload. Mon Mar 3 08:26:22 2008 -> Reading databases from /usr/share/clamav Mon Mar 3 08:40:26 2008 -> Database correctly reloaded (220846 signatures) Mon Mar 3 08:50:58 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 09:01:29 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 09:11:45 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database modification detected. Forcing reload. Mon Mar 3 09:11:45 2008 -> Reading databases from /usr/share/clamav Mon Mar 3 09:26:06 2008 -> Database correctly reloaded (220846 signatures) Mon Mar 3 09:26:06 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 09:36:34 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 09:47:23 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 10:02:17 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 10:13:18 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database modification detected. Forcing reload. Mon Mar 3 10:13:18 2008 -> Reading databases from /usr/share/clamav Mon Mar 3 10:27:35 2008 -> Database correctly reloaded (220846 signatures) Mon Mar 3 10:27:35 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 10:37:48 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 10:48:03 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 10:59:31 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database status OK. Mon Mar 3 11:13:38 2008 -> SelfCheck: Database modification detected. Forcing reload. Mon Mar 3 11:13:38 2008 -> Reading databases from /usr/share/clamav What's going on here? Thanks in advance! ------------------------------ >From buddgrbonu@gmail.com Sat Apr 26 15:52:25 2008 Message: 2 Date: Mon, 03 Mar 2008 20:44:35 +0200 From: T?r?k Edwin Subject: Re: [Clamav-users] clamd running full throttle To: ClamAV users ML Message-ID: <47CC4713.4080602@gmail.com> Content-Type: text/plain; charset=ISO-8859-1 Independent Edit wrote: > Currently running ClamAV 0.90.3 on an OS X Server installati